READ IT AS A TRADE, NOT AN IMPROVEMENT. A looser shape marks more
grabs; it does not make the marks mean more. research/
CCP_ENTRY_MODELS.md measured the shipped setting and found gross
expectancy at a grab is about zero, so nothing on this table is
known to be better than anything else on it — only busier or
quieter. Pick the one that matches what your eye calls a pin.
